---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import StackLayers from '../components/StackLayers.astro';
import AgentLoop from '../components/AgentLoop.astro';
import OutsideCode from '../components/OutsideCode.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About - Bhavyaveer" description="About Bhavyaveer and the systems, tools, and technologies he works with.">
  <section class="px-5 py-7 sm:px-6 md:px-10 md:py-10">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_320px] md:gap-10">
      <!-- Left Column: Heading + Content -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
        <SectionHeading title="What I do & what I'm building" />
        
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80 md:text-lg">
          I build AI-powered software, focusing primarily on agentic systems: 
          LLMs that plan, call tools, and coordinate with each other to complete complex workflows. 
          That spans across full-stack applications, robust backends, and the core model layer.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80 md:text-lg">
          Beyond web apps, I’m going deeper into the systems and evaluation side of AI:
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-3 grid max-w-prose list-disc grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/80 sm:grid-cols-2 md:text-base">
          <li>A multi-provider LLM gateway in Go, featuring caching, routing, and rate limiting.</li>
          <li>An evaluation harness for regression-testing prompts.</li>
          <li>An MLOps pipeline for fraud detection.</li>
          <li>A voice-driven AI agent.</li>
          <li>An AI powered vocabulary vault.</li>
          <li>A sandboxed online code-execution service.</li>
          <li>A CI/CD for a microservices app</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Agent Loop aligned to top -->
      <div>
        <AgentLoop />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 py-7 sm:px-6 md:px-10 md:py-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <SectionHeading title="Tech Stack" />
      <StackLayers />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 py-7 sm:px-6 md:px-10 md:py-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <SectionHeading title="Experience" />

      <article class="border-t border-ink py-5">
        <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_2fr] md:gap-10">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Software Engineering Intern</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/70">Stealth Startup</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/50">May 2026 – July 2026 · Remote</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/80 md:text-base">
            <li>Built a full-stack E-Way Bill management system using React, Express, and PostgreSQL, with workflows for creating, tracking, and managing bills.</li>
            <li>Implemented CSV and Excel bulk uploads with GSTIN and field validation, row previews, and batch processing for up to 500 records.</li>
            <li>Developed a WhatsApp message-processing pipeline using Express, BullMQ, Redis, and Supabase, including duplicate handling and delayed conversation processing.</li>
            <li>Created rule-based CRM analysis to extract customer requirements, logistics details, follow-up actions, and lead status from conversations.</li>
            <li>Added dashboards and audit views for bill analytics and CRM conversation summaries, requirements, and next steps.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="grid gap-8 border-t border-ink pt-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
        <section>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold md:text-xl">Achievements</h3>
          <article class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-accent pl-4">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold leading-snug">1st Runner-Up, Code Doc 2.0 Hackathon</h4>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/50">IEEE IAS &amp; PES · 25+ teams</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
              Built a LangChain-based financial analysis agent that parsed multi-format CSVs, categorized expenses using NLP, and generated personalized budget forecasts and predictive insights.
            </p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold md:text-xl">Certifications</h3>
          <article class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-accent pl-4">
            <a
              href="https://catalog-education.oracle.com/ords/certview/sharebadge?id=F1FFD775F47CBC8CAA706EF911BE6852B63775A8A919E5765A37CE23D9B43022"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-bold leading-snug hover:text-accent"
            >
              Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Certified Generative AI Professional ↗
            </a>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink/50">July 2026</p>
          </article>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 py-7 sm:px-6 md:px-10 md:py-10">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_360px] md:gap-10">
      <!-- Left Column: Text description -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
        <SectionHeading title="Outside the code" />
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80 md:text-lg">
          Away from the terminal, I channel creativity into producing trap beats and capturing landscape photography. 
          To keep my mind sharp, I enjoy reading books and solving complex puzzles. I also study financial systems and robotics, 
          play football, and travel to gain fresh perspectives.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Interactive Cube Component -->
      <div>
        <OutsideCode />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>